OAuth2 + Refresh Token Flow Diagram 🔄
Flow Explained Step by Step

User Login / Consent – User logs in and authorizes the client app.

Client Requests Tokens – Client exchanges credentials or authorization code for access + refresh tokens.

API Access with Access Token – Client calls API including Authorization: Bearer <access_token>.

